    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D — Retrieval Engine Dedicated Benchmark Gates (RT-BM-01..04). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Benchmark gates for the ThemisDB retrieval engine shard routing and GPU advisory path. These benchmarks are registered as Wave D acceptance gates.</para>
<para>Gate IDs: RT-BM-01 Single-shard exact routing throughput (CPU) RT-BM-02 Multi-shard routing throughput (16 shards, 8 workers) RT-BM-03 GPU advisory path throughput vs CPU baseline RT-BM-04 High-cardinality routing (100 K unique keys)</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>docs/operability/RUNBOOK_RETRIEVAL_ENGINE.md </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>src/retrieval/ROADMAP.md — Wave D Contribution </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
